      "message": "I\u0027m probably missing something, but I\u0027m a little confused as to why we need to fetch the config file if it already exists on disk? Is it to avoid staleness? (If so, isn\u0027t it a problem to do this fetch in the background, i.e. problematic to ever trust the copy on disk without a fetch?)",
